格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 用量与消耗插件（dsh-usage-plugin）—— 每次调用的 token 用量/缓存命中统计、峰谷计费、余额查询、CSV/JSON/PNG 导出，可经桌面端一键安装或命令行 dsh plugin add 安装。","id":"gh:1334268109","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-usage-plugin","slug":"feiyang-dev/dsh-usage-plugin","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","deepseek-v4","deepseek-v4-pro","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 用量与消耗插件（dsh-usage-plugin）—— 每次调用的 token 用量/缓存命中统计、峰谷计费、余额查询、CSV/JSON/PNG 导出，可经桌面端一键"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"安装或命令行 dsh plugin add 安装。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness Usage & Cost Tracker (dsh-usage-plugin)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"GitHub · npm · MIT License"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**A community plugin for DeepSeek Harness** — records token usage and cost for every model call, wit"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"h peak/off-peak billing, balance query, a calendar heatmap, and CSV / JSON / PNG export."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> ## 🔔 Important Notice (2026-08-16): npm package renamed\n>\n> The **npm package has been renamed fro"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"m `@feiyang666/deepseekharnessdesktop` to `@feiyang666/dsh-usage-plugin`** (matching the GitHub repo"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" `feiyang-dev/dsh-usage-plugin`).\n>\n> - Use the new package name for install / upgrade: `dsh plugin "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"--profile web add @feiyang666/dsh-usage-plugin`\n> - The old package `@feiyang666/deepseekharnessdesk"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"top` remains published for a while, but it is **no longer maintained and will not receive updates** "},{"id":"p6s6","text":"— please migrate soon.\n> - The desktop client (`DeepSeek Harness Desktop`) supports both package nam"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"es and will auto-detect old-name installs with a **one-click update** to the new name."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"dsh-usage-plugin is a **usage & cost tracker** plugin in the DeepSeek Harness ecosystem (a DSH plugi"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"n shipped as a Host + Client two-in-one package). After installation, **\"Usage & Cost\"** and **\"Bala"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"nce Query\"** tabs appear in the Web UI, right after \"Conversation\" and \"Trace\":"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> Supports **Windows / macOS / Linux**: paths are handled per platform (`node:path`), and the folder"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" picker / \"reveal in file manager\" use each OS's native mechanism (macOS: `osascript` / `open`; Linu"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"x: `zenity` / `xdg-open`). Balance query and export do not depend on Windows-only commands."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Usage & Cost**: records each model call's token usage and cache hits (input miss / cache hit / c"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ache write / output / reasoning / finish reason), and computes cost using DeepSeek's peak/valley or "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"base pricing (peak hours on weekdays are automatically priced by Beijing time 09:00–12:00 and 14:00–"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"18:00; since 2026-08-23 weekends are billed entirely at the off-peak rate; since 2026-09-10 12:00 Be"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ijing time the post-V4.1-Flash peak/valley prices apply — `deepseek-flash` off-peak cache hit 0.02 /"},{"id":"p10s6","text":" input 1 / output 4 CNY, peak at twice that). Model names come from the actual request parameters, s"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"o non-DeepSeek models are shown truthfully instead of \"unknown model\"; models without an official pr"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ice are counted as 0. The overview shows a by-model table plus a by-API-provider × model drill-down "},{"id":"p10s9","text":"(each provider grouped with every model's calls and peak/off-peak cost split) and a grand total row."},{"id":"p10s10","text":" The overview also supports **date filtering** (Today / Last 7 days / Last 30 days / All, plus a cus"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"tom start–end range), so the aggregate stats can be scoped to any single day or date range.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Usage & Consumption"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Balance Query"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Recommended Installation"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> Either method works and is equivalent. **We recommend the desktop app** — fully graphical, no comm"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"works and is equivalent. **We recommend the desktop app** — fully graphical, no command line needed."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option 1 (recommended): One-click via the desktop app"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Install DeepSeek Harness Desktop, open it, then go to **\"Install Plugins\" → Recommended → Usage & Co"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"st Tracker → Install** and click **\"Restart Service Now\"** to activate."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Option 2: Command line"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Or install to another profile:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Restart the dsh web service after installation. Detailed manual install / wiring / uninstall / troub"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"leshooting follows below."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## What's in the package"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"One npm package = a **host half** (Node-side Cordis plugin: recording, billing, balance query, expor"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"t — see `lib/index.js`) + a **client half** (browser-side panel — see `lib/client.js`, which talks t"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"o the host via `/usage/api`)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The package integrates with DSH through two declarations:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Declaration | Purpose |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `dsh.bundle.patch` (`cordis.patch.yml`) | Lets DSH recognize it as a **standard bundle plugin pack"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"age**: `dsh plugin --profile <name> add <package>` installs and wires it in one command, no manual c"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"onfig editing |\n| `dsh.client` + `exports[\"./client\"]` | Lets the web client auto-load the browser p"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"anel at `/plugins/<package>/client.js` |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"So for users, **installation is one command** — no YAML editing, no manual file copying."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Installation (for users)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### 0. Prerequisites"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness installed (`npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh`, or a desktop app built on it, or `n"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"px @deepseek-ai/dsh web`).\n- Option A (recommended) needs **pnpm**: `npm install -g pnpm` (or `corep"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ack enable`).\n- Make sure `dsh` is on PATH (for the desktop app, run in its bundled terminal)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 1. Method A (recommended): one command"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"This does three things (all automatic):"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. Installs the package via pnpm into `~/.dsh/profiles/web` (auto-initializes the profile on first u"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"se);\n2. Detects the package's `dsh.bundle` declaration and writes the package name into the profile'"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"s `dsh.profile.bundles` layer list;\n3. After restart, DSH reads the package's `cordis.patch.yml` and"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" mounts the plugin row into the app tree — **no manual config editing**."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Same for other profiles (replace `web` with your profile name, e.g. `dsh plugin --profile headless a"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"dd ...`; `dsh web` equals `dsh --profile web`)."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"> Test a local tarball: `dsh plugin --profile web add C:\\path\\to\\feiyang666-dsh-usage-plugin-1.9.0.t"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"est a local tarball: `dsh plugin --profile web add C:\\path\\to\\feiyang666-dsh-usage-plugin-1.9.0.tgz`"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### 2. Method B: manual install (no pnpm / no `dsh plugin`)"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Only for when you have no pnpm or want full manual control. **Do not `npm install` directly at `~/.d"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"sh/profiles`** (that dir has no package.json; npm would treat the whole node_modules as residue and "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"es`** (that dir has no package.json; npm would treat the whole node_modules as residue and wipe it)."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**B1. Use pnpm but not `dsh plugin`:**"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**B2. Or use npm:** add a minimal package.json to the profile first, then install:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**B3. Wire it up (once, idempotent):** append to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
